          "body": "I am fairly sure `etherent` here was being correctly used to mean an **ENT**ry in `/etc/ethers`, rather than being a misspelling of Ethernet.  It roughly follows the pattern of [gethostent](https://linux.die.net/man/3/gethostent) and similar libc functions.",
